.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-MODEL 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-model \- Manage the pinned default embedding model
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu model\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage the pinned default embedding model
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-model\-install(1)
Download and verify the default embedding model and tokenizer
.TP
quipu\-model\-backfill(1)
Embed one bounded batch of existing ROOT subjects
.TP
quipu\-model\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
